# Copy to telemetry/.env for `npm run numbers:web`. Never commit it.
# A current `npx wrangler login` also works; omit the API token when using that login.
#
# The page reads the daily summaries with the Cloudflare account we already hold, the same
# way `npm run numbers` does. The token needs D1 read on this account and nothing else.
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID="<the Cloudflare account id>"
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN="<a token that may read the telemetry D1 database>"

# Optional: the page's AI cost section reads Cloud's database (cloud.ai_calls) once at startup.
# The same two values cloud/.env holds, and read from there when left out here. Without them
# only that section is unavailable.
# SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF="<the Cloud project's ref>"
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN="<a Supabase access token for that project>"
